load @term/seed/code/structure/ring
  find ring

# An Azumaya algebra: a ring that is, locally over its center, a full matrix algebra, the algebraic generalization of a
# central simple algebra to families. It is the natural home of the Brauer group, which classifies division algebras
# over a field, and the quaternions are the simplest nontrivial example. The form carries the underlying ring.
form azumaya-algebra
  link ring, like ring
